      <problem>
        <paragraph>Celsius and Fahrenheit TemperaturesThe relationship between Celsius $$({}_{}^{})$$ and Fahrenheit $$({}_{}^{})$$ temperatures is given by the formula</paragraph>
        <paragraph math="block">$$C = \frac{5}{9}(F - 32)$$</paragraph>
        <list type="ordered">
          <item>If the average temperature range for Montreal during the month of January is $$- 15^{{^\circ}} &lt; C &lt; - 5^{{^\circ}}$$ , find the range in degrees Fahrenheit in Montreal for the same period.</item>
